cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  KRAKEN is described in an accompanying manuscript (in review); please cite that
  publication. This repository is archived on Zenodo only to provide a persistent,
  citable snapshot of the code for availability and reproducibility.
title: "KRAKEN: Knowledge Research & Analysis Kit for Evidence Networks"
abstract: >-
  Build system for KRAKEN, a unified, Biolink Model-compliant biomedical
  knowledge graph integrating many aggregator knowledge graphs, ontologies,
  vocabularies, and specialized resources.
